### 1. Get All Children (CORRECTED)
GET http://localhost:8080/parent/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Link Child (CORRECTED)
POST http://localhost:8080/parent/link-child
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "childCode": "TEST123",
  "relationship": "FATHER"
}

### 3. Get Child Progress (CORRECTED)
GET http://localhost:8080/parent/child/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Send Message (CORRECTED)
POST http://localhost:8080/parent/message-child
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "childId": 1,
  "message": "Test message"
}

### 5. Set Daily Goal (CORRECTED)
POST http://localhost:8080/parent/set-daily-goal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "childId": 1,
  "goalMinutes": 30
}

### 6. Request Teacher Review (CORRECTED)
POST http://localhost:8080/parent/request-teacher-review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "childId": 1,
  "teacherId": 1,
  "comments": "Test review"
}